        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 3506, Retro Manhattan Mortise Entrance Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Retro Manhattan Mortise Entrance Lockset has all the classic elegance of some of New York's most historic architecture. The stepped sides is the perfect marriage between the old and new, making this entryset a great choice for traditional spaces that want a more contemporary look. The Manhattan Mortise Entry Set will fit either 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. Choose from a whole array of transitional finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"2\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td class=\"text\">\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Emtek Manhattan Entryset and the ANSI F20 Heavy Duty Lock Body:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Deadlocking latch bolt with saw-proof inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick security latch.</li>\r\n<li>When the deadbolt is engaged, the outside thumb press is automatically locked.</li>\r\n<li>The latch bolt is retracted by the knob or lever on either side, except when the outside thumb press is locked by stop button, then it can only be opened from the exterior by use of the key. Making it ideal for doors you want to automatically lock. This feature can be easily toggled on and off by pressing the stop and release button on the mortise box face.</li>\r\n<li>Operating the interior trim retracts both the deadbolt and the latch bolt for emergency egress.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td align=\"right\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-diagram.jpg?v=1704354539\" width=\"189\" height=\"255\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek F20\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Middleton Keyed Entry Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-45/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Trim Center to Center: 3-11/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-3/4\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-3506-specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\"><b>Emtek 3506 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-Mortise-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262243\"><b>Emtek ANSI F20 Mortise Box Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-F20-Mortise-Install.pdf?v=1704262243\"><b>Emtek ANSI F20 Mortise Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-3506-finish.jpg?v=1704354725\" width=\"600\" height=\"102\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 3506 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Manhattan Mortise Entry Set",
                "description": "The Retro Manhattan Mortise Entrance Lockset has all the classic elegance of some of New York's most historic architecture. The stepped sides is the perfect marriage between the old and new, making this entryset a great choice for traditional spaces that want a more contemporary look. The Manhattan Mortise Entry Set will fit either 2-1/2 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. Choose from a whole array of transitional finishes.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Manhattan Mortise Entrance Locksets, Manhattan Mortise Entry Sets, Emtek 3506, Emtek Manhattan Mortise Entrance Handlesets, Manhattan Mortise Handlesets, Emtek 3106, Emtek Manhattan knob by knob entrance Locksets, Emtek Manhattan lever by lever entrance Locksets, retro Handlesets, traditional Handlesets, steep Handlesets, Retro Manhattan Mortise Entrance Locksets, Emtek Keyed Entry Plates, EMT-F20-3506"
